    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "One line a message: the time, the author in a column, then the text. The author is left blank for the same person within five minutes. A thin line marks a new day, and a thread's replies sit under one divider. In a narrow panel the author and time take a line and the text sits under it."
      }
    ],
    [],
    [
      {
        "ink": "emphasis",
        "strong": true,
        "text": "cozy     "
      },
      {
        "ink": "good"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "text": "The roomier layout: the author, place and date on a line, the text under it, the reactions on a line of their own, a blank line between messages, and replies two cells in."
      }
    ],
